9	umar sulayman	umar	sulayman	male	instructor of linguistics and arabic	education	\N	arizona state university	higher education	united states	arizona	united states	arizona	Umar completed his B.A. with Honors in the English Language and Literature in 2000 and M.A. in English Linguistics at the University of Baghdad in 2004. He taught in different educational settings in Baghdad/Iraq from private language institutes to public and private universities. In 2006, he received one of the Fulbright scholarships to complete his M.A. in TESOL at the Indiana University of Pennsylvania. In 2009, he joined Ohio Northern University to teach ESL/ESP and the following year, he was appointed the director of ESP for the Prison Management Certificate Program. At Ohio Northern University, Umar developed the Arabic language program at the department of modern languages. Currently, Umar is teaching ESL for Global Launch/Arizona State University. Additionally, Umar is pursuing his PhD in Linguistics and Applied Linguistics at ASU.	{"higher education","public speaking",teaching,"curriculum design","university teaching",linguistics,esl,grammar,"foreign languages",courses,research,"teaching english as a second language",arabic,"microsoft office","student affairs","adult education","student development","community outreach","modern standard arabic","student recruiting","curriculum development","english as a second language",education,"international admissions","admissions counseling"}	[{"title": {"name": "instructor of linguistics and arabic", "role": "education", "levels": [], "sub_role": "professor"}, "company": {"id": "arizona-state-university", "name": "arizona state university", "size": "10001+", "founded": "1885", "website": "asu.edu", "industry": "higher education", "location": {"geo": "33.41,-111.90", "name": "tempe, arizona, united states", "metro": "phoenix, arizona", "region": "arizona", "country": "united states", "locality": "tempe", "continent": "north america", "postal_code": "85287", "address_line_2": null, "street_address": null}, "linkedin_id": "4292", "twitter_url": null, "facebook_url": null, "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/company/arizona-state-university"}, "summary": null, "end_date": null, "is_primary": true, "start_date": "2017-06", "location_names": ["tempe, arizona, united states"]}, {"title": {"name": "instructor of arabic", "role": "education", "levels": [], "sub_role": "professor"}, "company": {"id": "ohio-northern-university", "name": "ohio northern university", "size": "1001-5000", "founded": "1871", "website": "onu.edu", "industry": "higher education", "location": {"geo": "40.76,-83.82", "name": "ada, ohio, united states", "metro": null, "region": "ohio", "country": "united states", "locality": "ada", "continent": "north america", "postal_code": "45810", "address_line_2": null, "street_address": "525 south main street"}, "linkedin_id": "165291", "twitter_url": "twitter.com/ohionorthern", "facebook_url": "facebook.com/ohionorthern", "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/company/ohio-northern-university"}, "summary": "* The Department of Modern Languages at Ohio Northern University offers language classes in 6 languages. Arabic was added to the curriculum after my Arabic program proposal was approved by the curriculum committee.\\n* Designed and established the Arabic program.\\n* Taught Elementary and Intermediate Arabic.", "end_date": "2015-07", "is_primary": false, "start_date": "2010-08", "location_names": []}, {"title": {"name": "director of english for specific purposes and prison management certificate program", "role": "operations", "levels": ["director"], "sub_role": null}, "company": {"id": "ohio-northern-university", "name": "ohio northern university", "size": "1001-5000", "founded": "1871", "website": "onu.edu", "industry": "higher education", "location": {"geo": "40.76,-83.82", "name": "ada, ohio, united states", "metro": null, "region": "ohio", "country": "united states", "locality": "ada", "continent": "north america", "postal_code": "45810", "address_line_2": null, "street_address": "525 south main street"}, "linkedin_id": "165291", "twitter_url": "twitter.com/ohionorthern", "facebook_url": "facebook.com/ohionorthern", "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/company/ohio-northern-university"}, "summary": "* In 2009, Ohio Northern University signed a contract with the Saudi Ministry of Interior to train 30 Saudi prison wardens and assistant wardens. The program is of three components: ESL, academic classes, and an internship. After developing an English for Specific Purposes that fits the needs of the officers and meets the program director's expectation, I was put in charge of the English component of the program. Between 2009 and 2015, We taught and trained 90 Saudi officers.\\n* Taught ESP courses.\\n* Supervised all the ESP instructors in the program.\\n* Supervised language labs and content-based instruction labs.\\n* Led new students' orientation.\\n* Assisted students settle in the US.\\n* Interpreted to program coordinator and students whenever asked.\\n* Designed an ESP program for the Prison Management Certificate Program (PMCP).\\n* Designed and supervised an ESL program for the PMCP students’ spouses.\\n* Taught ESP content-based classes (Criminology, American Government, Comparative\\n* Criminal Justice, Corrections, and Policies of Corrections).", "end_date": "2015-06", "is_primary": false, "start_date": "2010-04", "location_names": []}, {"title": {"name": "adjunct instructor of esl and iep", "role": "education", "levels": [], "sub_role": "professor"}, "company": {"id": "ohio-northern-university", "name": "ohio northern university", "size": "1001-5000", "founded": "1871", "website": "onu.edu", "industry": "higher education", "location": {"geo": "40.76,-83.82", "name": "ada, ohio, united states", "metro": null, "region": "ohio", "country": "united states", "locality": "ada", "continent": "north america", "postal_code": "45810", "address_line_2": null, "street_address": "525 south main street"}, "linkedin_id": "165291", "twitter_url": "twitter.com/ohionorthern", "facebook_url": "facebook.com/ohionorthern", "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/company/ohio-northern-university"}, "summary": "With the growing number of ESL students on campus. I was asked to serve as a part-time ESL faculty for our Intensive English program. - Taught two grammar and listening/speaking classes.", "end_date": "2012-05", "is_primary": false, "start_date": "2012-02", "location_names": []}, {"title": {"name": "instructor of esl and prison management certificate program", "role": "education", "levels": [], "sub_role": "professor"}, "company": {"id": "ohio-northern-university", "name": "ohio northern university", "size": "1001-5000", "founded": "1871", "website": "onu.edu", "industry": "higher education", "location": {"geo": "40.76,-83.82", "name": "ada, ohio, united states", "metro": null, "region": "ohio", "country": "united states", "locality": "ada", "continent": "north america", "postal_code": "45810", "address_line_2": null, "street_address": "525 south main street"}, "linkedin_id": "165291", "twitter_url": "twitter.com/ohionorthern", "facebook_url": "facebook.com/ohionorthern", "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/company/ohio-northern-university"}, "summary": "I joined the Prison Management Certificate Program. -Taught Grammar, Listening/Speaking and Vocabulary classes", "end_date": "2010-08", "is_primary": false, "start_date": "2009-09", "location_names": []}, {"title": {"name": "instructor of english", "role": "education", "levels": [], "sub_role": "professor"}, "company": {"id": null, "name": "al mansour university college national computing centre", "size": null, "founded": null, "website": null, "industry": null, "location": null, "linkedin_id": null, "twitter_url": null, "facebook_url": null, "linkedin_url": null}, "summary": "* The National Computing Centre, NCC based in the United Kingdom, opened it's first branch in Iraq at Al Mansour University College. I was hired to prepare train the first group of MUC students who were applying for the NCC.\\n* Administered placement tests and assigned students to levels.\\n* Taught EAP to students of Business, Engineering, and Computer Science majors.\\n* Taught TOEFL preparation courses.\\n* Monitored and graded students’ exams.\\n* Advised and helped students interested in applying for scholarships (Fulbright, DAAD, and Chevening).", "end_date": "2006-06", "is_primary": false, "start_date": "2004-08", "location_names": []}, {"title": {"name": "adjunct professor of english and general linguistics", "role": "education", "levels": [], "sub_role": "professor"}, "company": {"id": null, "name": "the university of baghdad the college of arts", "size": null, "founded": null, "website": null, "industry": null, "location": null, "linkedin_id": null, "twitter_url": null, "facebook_url": null, "linkedin_url": null}, "summary": "* The University of Baghdad is the oldest and largest University in Iraq. The College of Arts is one of the oldest colleges in the university.\\n* Taught General Linguistics classes to freshmen students.\\n* Taught English as a foreign language at the department of Arabic.", "end_date": "2006-05", "is_primary": false, "start_date": "2004-08", "location_names": []}]	[{"gpa": null, "majors": ["philosophy", "linguistics", "applied linguistics"], "minors": [], "school": {"id": "-sTe237DqHuY1hgBysoAhg_0", "name": "arizona state university", "type": "post-secondary institution", "domain": "asu.edu", "website": "asu.edu", "location": {"name": "tempe, arizona, united states", "region": "arizona", "country": "united states", "locality": "tempe", "continent": "north america"}, "linkedin_id": "17769", "twitter_url": "twitter.com/asu", "facebook_url": "facebook.com/arizonastateuniversity", "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/school/arizona-state-university"}, "degrees": ["doctorates", "doctor of philosophy"], "summary": "Currently pursuing the degree", "end_date": "2021", "start_date": "20