44	umar sulayman	umar	sulayman	male	instructor of linguistics and arabic	education	\N	arizona state university	higher education	united states	arizona	united states	arizona	Umar completed his B.A. with Honors in the English Language and Literature in 2000 and M.A. in English Linguistics at the University of Baghdad in 2004. He taught in different educational settings in Baghdad/Iraq from private language institutes to public and private universities. In 2006, he received one of the Fulbright scholarships to complete his M.A. in TESOL at the Indiana University of Pennsylvania. In 2009, he joined Ohio Northern University to teach ESL/ESP and the following year, he was appointed the director of ESP for the Prison Management Certificate Program. At Ohio Northern University, Umar developed the Arabic language program at the department of modern languages. Currently, Umar is teaching ESL for Global Launch/Arizona State University. Additionally, Umar is pursuing his PhD in Linguistics and Applied Linguistics at ASU.	{"higher education","public speaking",teaching,"curriculum design","university teaching",linguistics,esl,grammar,"foreign languages",courses,research,"teaching english as a second language",arabic,"microsoft office","student affairs","adult education","student development","community outreach","modern standard arabic","student recruiting","curriculum development","english as a second language",education,"international admissions","admissions counseling"}	[{"title": {"name": "instructor of linguistics and arabic", "role": "education", "levels": [], "sub_role": "professor"}, "company": {"id": "arizona-state-university", "name": "arizona state university", "size": "10001+", "founded": "1885", "website": "asu.edu", "industry": "higher education", "location": {"geo": "33.41,-111.90", "name": "tempe, arizona, united states", "metro": "phoenix, arizona", "region": "arizona", "country": "united states", "locality": "tempe", "continent": "north america", "postal_code": "85287", "address_line_2": null, "street_address": null}, "linkedin_id": "4292", "twitter_url": null, "facebook_url": null, "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/company/arizona-state-university"}, "summary": null, "end_date": null, "is_primary": true, "start_date": "2017-06", "location_names": ["tempe, arizona, united states"]}, {"title": {"name": "instructor of arabic", "role": "education", "levels": [], "sub_role": "professor"}, "company": {"id": "ohio-northern-university", "name": "ohio northern university", "size": "1001-5000", "founded": "1871", "website": "onu.edu", "industry": "higher education", "location": {"geo": "40.76,-83.82", "name": "ada, ohio, united states", "metro": null, "region": "ohio", "country": "united states", "locality": "ada", "continent": "north america", "postal_code": "45810", "address_line_2": null, "street_address": "525 south main street"}, "linkedin_id": "165291", "twitter_url": "twitter.com/ohionorthern", "facebook_url": "facebook.com/ohionorthern", "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/company/ohio-northern-university"}, "summary": "* The Department of Modern Languages at Ohio Northern University offers language classes in 6 languages. Arabic was added to the curriculum after my Arabic program proposal was approved by the curriculum committee.\\n* Designed and established the Arabic program.\\n* Taught Elementary and Intermediate Arabic.", "end_date": "2015-07", "is_primary": false, "start_date": "2010-08", "location_names": []}, {"title": {"name": "director of english for specific purposes and prison management certificate program", "role": "operations", "levels": ["director"], "sub_role": null}, "company": {"id": "ohio-northern-university", "name": "ohio northern university", "size": "1001-5000", "founded": "1871", "website": "onu.edu", "industry": "higher education", "location": {"geo": "40.76,-83.82", "name": "ada, ohio, united states", "metro": null, "region": "ohio", "country": "united states", "locality": "ada", "continent": "north america", "postal_code": "45810", "address_line_2": null, "street_address": "525 south main street"}, "linkedin_id": "165291", "twitter_url": "twitter.com/ohionorthern", "facebook_url": "facebook.com/ohionorthern", "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/company/ohio-northern-university"}, "summary": "* In 2009, Ohio Northern University signed a contract with the Saudi Ministry of Interior to train 30 Saudi prison wardens and assistant wardens. The program is of three components: ESL, academic classes, and an internship. After developing an English for Specific Purposes that fits the needs of the officers and meets the program director's expectation, I was put in charge of the English component of the program. Between 2009 and 2015, We taught and trained 90 Saudi officers.\\n* Taught ESP courses.\\n* Supervised all the ESP instructors in the program.\\n* Supervised language labs and content-based instruction labs.\\n* Led new students' orientation.\\n* Assisted students settle in the US.\\n* Interpreted to program coordinator and students whenever asked.\\n* Designed an ESP program for the Prison Management Certificate Program (PMCP).\\n* Designed and supervised an ESL program for the PMCP students’ spouses.\\n* Taught ESP content-based classes (Criminology, American Government, Comparative\\n* Criminal Justice, Corrections, and Policies of Corrections).", "end_date": "2015-06", "is_primary": false, "start_date": "2010-04", "location_names": []}, {"title": {"name": "adjunct instructor of esl and iep", "role": "education", "levels": [], "sub_role": "professor"}, "company": {"id": "ohio-northern-university", "name": "ohio northern university", "size": "1001-5000", "founded": "1871", "website": "onu.edu", "industry": "higher education", "location": {"geo": "40.76,-83.82", "name": "ada, ohio, united states", "metro": null, "region": "ohio", "country": "united states", "locality": "ada", "continent": "north america", "postal_code": "45810", "address_line_2": null, "street_address": "525 s