 "Senior Director (Commanding Officer) of a Combined Arms Battalion of 832 Soldiers consisting of two infantry companies, two armor companies, one forward support company, and one headquarters company. Trained them for counter-insurgency and foreign internal defense operations. Deployed to Iraq from 2010 to 2011, operating in northern Baghdad focusing on advise and assist operations with the 9th and 11th Iraqi Army Divisions while also conducting the retrograde and transfer of equipment during the closure of operations in Iraq. Redeployed and reset the battalion in preparation for future operations in late 2011. Provided for the morale and well-being of the soldiers and their families through a vibrant and proactive family readiness group.", "end_date": "2012-05", "is_primary": false, "start_date": "2010-05", "location_names": ["fort riley, kansas, united states"]}, {"title": {"name": "senior project manager", "role": "operations", "levels": ["manager", "senior"], "sub_role": "project_management"}, "company": {"id": "fort-irwin-national-training-center", "name": "fort irwin national training center", "size": "5001-10000", "founded": "1980", "website": null, "industry": "e-learning", "location": {"geo": "35.26,-116.68", "name": "fort irwin, california, united states", "metro": "riverside, california", "region": "california", "country": "united states", "locality": "fort irwin", "continent": "north america", "postal_code": "92310", "address_line_2": null, "street_address": null}, "linkedin_id": "5673076", "twitter_url": null, "facebook_url": null, "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/company/fort-irwin-national-training-center"}, "summary": "Planned, resourced and supervised the operations and training of Operations Group at the National Training Center, Fort Irwin, CA. Ensured the successful support of 13 training rotations to prepare units for their deployment to either Iraq or Afghanistan during the Global War on Terror.", "end_date": "2010-04", "is_primary": false, "star