ty Development Integration Directorate (MC-CDID), the Electronic Warfare Proponency Office (EWPO), and the Army Irregular Warfare Fusion Center (AIWFC).", "end_date": "2013-06", "is_primary": false, "start_date": "2012-03", "location_names": []}, {"title": {"name": "military analyst and capability developer", "role": "engineering", "levels": [], "sub_role": null}, "company": {"id": "us-army", "name": "us army", "size": "10001+", "founded": "1775", "website": "goarmy.com", "industry": "military", "location": {"geo": "38.89,-77.08", "name": "arlington, virginia, united states", "metro": "district of columbia", "region": "virginia", "country": "united states", "locality": "arlington", "continent": "north america", "postal_code": null, "address_line_2": null, "street_address": "1500 army navy drive"}, "linkedin_id": "1223", "twitter_url": "twitter.com/goarmy", "facebook_url": "facebook.com/goarmy", "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/company/us-army"}, "summary": "Analyst for the TRADOC Capability manager Mission Command (TCM MC). Responsible for performing duties as the TRADOC representative at the Department of the Army, PEO C3T, CTSF, ATEC, various working groups, meeting and forums. Voting representative on the Central Technical Support Facility (CTSF) Executive Scorting Committee. Supports the migration of current command, control, communications, computers, intelligence, surveillance and reconnaissance (C$ISR) systems into an integrated, interoperable and collaborative network with standard command and control functions from strategic and tactical levels to individual plafroms for support to the warfighter soldier in Joint, Interagencey, Intergovernmental, and Multinational (JIIM) environments.", "end_date": "2012-03", "is_primary": false, "start_date": "2011-10", "location_names": []}, {"title": {"name": "brigade automations management officer", "role": null, "levels": [], "sub_role": null}, "company": {"id": "us-army", "name": "us army", "size": "10001+", "founded": "